 .com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/DaCamera-Jason-Hainsworth-New-Jazz-Undergr
 ound-in-Concert-at-Miller-Outdoor-Theatre.jpeg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston.com/wp-content/uploads
 /2026/07/DaCamera-Jason-Hainsworth-New-Jazz-Underground-in-Concert-at-Mill
 er-Outdoor-Theatre.jpeg
UID:4qdD3XHXqG9UzNl1zUuYp
SUMMARY:DaCamera: Jason Hainsworth & New Jazz Underground in Concert at Mil
	ler Outdoor Theatre
DTSTAMP:20260820T033113Z
DTSTART:20260821T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Miller Outdoor Theatre and DaCamera present Jason Hainsworth an
	d New Jazz Underground in a night of live music under the stars in Hermann
	 Park. \nThe jazz double bill features Jason Hainsworth—a celebrated Houst
	on native bringing passionate new life to a unique\, historically-signific
	ant sound pioneered by Texas musicians—and New Jazz Underground—an electri
	fying New York-based trio pushing the boundaries of jazz. \nFinding Your S
	eat at Miller Outdoor Theatre \nAs always\, all seats at Miller are free\,
	 but covered seating for popular evening shows usually requires a free ass
	igned ticket reserved 24 hours in advance. \nLearn more about getting free
	 seated tickets at Miller. \nAdmission\nFree. Learn more or reserve a free
	 seated ticket. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the e
	vent organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details.  
	\nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or off
	er across all of our channels.\n\nhttps://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/
	dacamera-jason-hainsworth-new-jazz-underground-in-concert-at-miller-outdoo
	r-theatre/\n\nFrom 365 Things to Do in Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/dacamera-jason-hainsworth-new-j
	azz-underground-in-concert-at-miller-outdoor-theatre/
LOCATION:Miller Outdoor Theatre\, 6000 Hermann Park Dr\, Houston\, TX\, 770
	30\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:365-things-houston
CATEGORIES:365 Things to Do in Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT1H
END:VEVENT
